  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, by virtue of its substandard living conditions and lack of good quality communal spaces is incapable of meeting the reasonable needs of occupiers, contrary to Section 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D6 of the London Plan (2021), CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), DMD5 and DMD8 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014).",
    "The proposed single-storey rear extension, by reason of its excessive depth, siting and height, would result in an overbearing and unneighbourly form of development that would harm the residential amenities of the adjoining occupiers at No. 105 Goat Lane. The proposal would lead to a loss of outlook, increased sense of enclosure, and reduced access to light contrary to Policy CP30 of the Core Strategy (2010) and Policy DMD11 of the Development Management Document (2014).",
    "The proposed development in the absence of adequate cycle storage and by virtue of its means of access, location and layout would fail to provide a secure, convenient and high quality facility for all types of bicycles and would fail to promote or prioritise the use of sustainable modes of transport, contrary to Section 9 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies T1 and T5 of the London Plan (2021), CP25 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010) and DMD45 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
  ],
